  "summary": "11:45 AM - 12:45 PM: The group explored Voo Store’s fashion displays, enjoyed coffee in the café, and then visited Modern Graphics to browse and discuss graphic novels and artbooks together."
}

{
  "summary": "13:00 - 14:30: The group dined at Kimchi Princess, spending 90 minutes grilling and sharing Korean BBQ dishes while enjoying lively conversation and exploring new flavors together."
}

{
  "summary": "14:45 - 16:45: The traveler and friends sampled cheesecake and coffee at Five Elephant café before relaxing with drinks and lively conversation at Dietrich Bar."
}

{
  "summary": "17:00 - 19:00: The traveler explored contemporary art at Galerie Met and then enjoyed Sudanese snacks and socializing at Basmah, making the most of an unexpected change in plans."
